! ---- Trace engine parity: TRACECMP compares the legacy real-ray tracer ----
! (RAYTRA2) against the new global-free engine (mod_ray_trace_engine) over an
! 8x8 pupil grid, for several lenses and fields.  BRIEF mode prints only
! deterministic counts and the verdict -- no floating-point deltas.
! Until the engine supports a lens the verdict is SKIP (the legacy counts are
! still checked); once supported it must be PASS.
RES osdtriplet
FOB 0
TRACECMP 8 BRIEF
FOB 1
TRACECMP 8 BRIEF
CV2PRG DoubleGauss.seq
FOB 0
TRACECMP 8 BRIEF
FOB 0.7
TRACECMP 8 BRIEF
FOB 1
TRACECMP 8 BRIEF
CV2PRG LithoKotaro.seq
FOB 0
TRACECMP 8 BRIEF
FOB 1
TRACECMP 8 BRIEF
! Ray aiming: default is ON, so toggle it OFF, then back ON.
RES osdtriplet
RAYAIM OFF
FOB 1
TRACECMP 8 BRIEF
RAYAIM ON
FOB 1
TRACECMP 8 BRIEF
! Mirror system (reflection).  Built inline: Library/Projects/OSDmirror.zoa
! is a command script that ends in VIE, which would leave the plot's
! settings level active and swallow the commands that follow.
LEN NEW
EPD 20
TIT 'OSDmirror'
RDY S1 -100
RMD S1 REFL
PIM
FOB 0
TRACECMP 8 BRIEF
FOB 1
TRACECMP 8 BRIEF
! Telecentric aiming, finite object.  (LithoKotaroTelOBNA.seq would be the
! natural fixture, but CV2PRG rejects its NAO line and the import fails, so
! switch telecentric aiming on for LithoKotaro instead.)
CV2PRG LithoKotaro.seq
TEL ON
FOB 1
TRACECMP 8 BRIEF
TEL OFF
! A tilted surface (same tilt the tilts_decenters test applies).
RES osdtriplet
STILT 2 0.5 0 0
FOB 0.7
TRACECMP 8 BRIEF
